             (clock-icon.png, refresh-icon.png) from before this add-on had
             an icon font at all; they are Lucide glyphs now, which is what
             every other icon in the UI already was.

             The mark is a flat dark disc with a hairline ring, measured off
             the real Apple TV app: disc fill rgb(56,58,61), ring
             rgb(97,93,67), 175px across, clock glyph rgb(233,179,27) at
             roughly half the disc. It used to be a 300px orange radial
             bloom over a glow-circle.png texture. That glow came from the
             Android app and has no counterpart on Apple TV, which is this
             client's reference; deleting it also retired the last asset on
             issue 6 that nobody could supply, since a disc and a ring are
             assets we already generate. -->
